            "review_title": "Review at SI Mixology",
            "review_text": "Lolita V\n37 contributions\n0\nDon’t bother. Cocktails will give you diabetes\nJul 2024 • Solo\nThough the space offers a modern vibe, this is the typical spot that attracts a big crowd of influencers posing to get their photos taken all over the place. The food was OK. The cocktail I ordered was not supposed to be sweet, and even I confirmed it with the bartender and the hostess before ordering it. However, I was presented with a cocktail so sweet that it almost gave me diabetes from the first sip. I sent it back, and they brought me the same sweet cocktail again. Literally, the same one. I sent it back a second time, and they brought me what looked like a low-effort, bad faith attempt at making a non-sweet cocktail. Terrible. I called them out for it. They still charged me the full price for a cocktail not worth a single dime. There are many bars in town where you can enjoy great drinks at a normal price point. If you come here, you will be paying Western prices for bad drinks and mediocre service. Many more iconic places in Hanoi, some even feature stunning views of the city.\nRead more\nWritten July 28, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
